# No image is built from the repository root yet (the services in
# `compose.yaml` mount their code read-only); should one be, re-include only
# the files it needs below `*`. Local secrets (e.g. `.env`, `.env.local`,
# `.envrc`) and other secret files must never reach a build, also not within
# re-included paths
*
**/.env*
**/*.env
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/id_rsa*
**/id_ed25519*
**/id_ecdsa*
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/.git-credentials
**/.pypirc
**/credentials*.json
**/.netrc
